  "body": "## What changed\n\nAdd the MCP skill row in `.claude/skills/camcraft-mcp/SKILL.md` for the 2D Adaptive rest machining parameter (part of #1446).\nThe new row is placed directly after \"2D Pocket rest machining (#1489)\" and details the `edit_operation` JSON merge-patch schema, required and optional parameters, and refusal rules.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `cargo xtask gate quick --dry-run`: 0 crate files touched, 0 steps failed.\n- Checked git diff to ensure `.claude/PROCESS_VERSION` is untouched.\n- Clean review against repository ASD-STE100 guidelines and AGENTS.md conventions.\n\n## Not exercised\n\nProduct crates (no code in `crates/` changed; process/skill file update only).\n\nProcess change: yes\nChangelog: none\nEffort: low\nfork synced at v0.24.0\n\nFixes #2885\n",
